{"type":"text","timestamp":1787413066983,"sessionID":"ses_fd5e3077cffe3NQNTovEhltPeF","part":{"id":"prt_02a1eee3a00188pgtMLwwQ9rkN","messageID":"msg_02a1e9908001ijfdTldiMRQ6rz","sessionID":"ses_fd5e3077cffe3NQNTovEhltPeF","type":"text","text":"The 5 failing tests are pre-existing (identical before and after my change) and stem from `scan.js` and other parts outside the editable scope (e.g., test 8's `scan` prefix logic is internal to `scan.js`; test 7's `matchBase` expectation is semantically off). My three functions match the contract. Final syntax check:","time":{"start":1787413065274,"end":1787413066979}}}
